  "body": "After 28 years the time has come for our vendors to downsize their home. \r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented property offers a rare combination of style, space, and stunning views, all in one of Orewa’s most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nSet across two generous levels on an elevated 747sqm (more or less) site, the home captures sweeping views over Orewa and out to the sparkling sea, filling the interiors with natural light and all-day sun.\r\n\r\nInside, you'll find four well-proportioned bedrooms and three bathrooms, ideal for families of all sizes or those who enjoy hosting guests. The living areas are spacious and light-filled, with a contemporary kitchen at the heart of the home — designed for both everyday ease and effortless entertaining. Seamless indoor-outdoor flow leads to a large deck — the perfect spot to unwind or entertain while soaking in the breathtaking coastal outlook.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, a versatile rumpus room provides extra space for teenagers, a second lounge, or a home office, while a dedicated workshop area adds further flexibility for hobbies or storage. The home has been recently renovated with modern décor, ensuring you can move in and enjoy from day one.\r\n\r\nSet on a fabulous, landscaped garden with an established orchard and vege garden, there’s plenty of room for kids to play, enjoy summer BBQs, or simply relax in your own private haven. A generous double garage, plenty of off-street parking for boats, trailers, or caravans, and ample storage complete the package.\r\n\r\nConveniently located in one of Orewa’s premier quiet streets, yet close to local shops, the beach, and motorway access, this is a home that truly ticks every box — from lifestyle to location.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss this opportunity to secure a stylish, spacious family home with spectacular views in a highly desirable part of Orewa.",
